    customs_reality_en: "Most developed Pacific Island nation for customs. Suva and Lautoka ports handle most cargo. VAT at 9% is low. Duty rates 0-32% (higher on protective tariffs for local industry). Strict biosecurity — all food/plant/animal imports inspected (can add 1-3 days). DHL and FedEx available. Postal mail 2-4 weeks. Cyclone season (Nov-Apr) can disrupt shipping. Import Substitution & Export Finance Facility incentives. Major imports from Australia, NZ, Singapore, China. Reasonable efficiency for Pacific standards.",
