    customs_reality_en: "EEA member but NOT EU — customs duties apply to non-EEA goods. Efficient customs, small volume. Low de minimis at ~ISK 10,000 ($70) means most online purchases face duties. High agricultural tariffs protect domestic farming. 24% VAT adds significantly to import costs. Express and postal clearance typically fast (1-2 days).",
