    customs_reality_en: "French territory with its own customs regime (not EU). Well-organized French administrative system. TGC at 11%. Protective tariffs (up to 30%) on goods competing with local industry. Nouméa port is modern. DHL, Chronopost available. Postal service via OPT NC — 1-2 weeks from France, 2-4 weeks from elsewhere. Nickel mining industry means good cargo infrastructure. Most imports from France, Australia, and China. High cost of living. Biosecurity is strict (island ecosystem protection).",
