    de_minimis_usd: 35,
    clearance_process_en: "Norwegian Customs (Tollvesenet/Tolletaten) uses the TVINN electronic declaration system. Norway is an EEA member but NOT in the EU customs union — has its own tariff schedule. Oslo, Bergen, Stavanger ports and Oslo Gardermoen airport handle cargo. Posten Norge handles postal customs.",
