    clearance_process_en: "Nepal Department of Customs manages imports. ASYCUDA World system for electronic declarations. Land-locked country — most imports transit through India (Kolkata/Vishakhapatnam ports). Birgunj dry port and Tribhuvan International Airport (Kathmandu) are main entry points. Tariff rates range from 0% to 80%, with vehicles at highest band.",
