    de_minimis_usd: 0,
    clearance_process_en: "Federal Board of Revenue (FBR) manages customs via WeBOC (Web-Based One Customs) electronic system. Tariff rates 0-20% customs duty plus regulatory duty (RD) of 0-35% and additional customs duty (ACD) of 2-7%. Karachi port handles 60%+ of imports. Lahore and Islamabad airports for air cargo. Pakistan-China FTA provides preferential rates.",
