    clearance_process_en: "Qatar General Authority of Customs manages imports under GCC Common External Tariff. Standard 5% duty, 0% on food staples, 100% on tobacco and alcohol. Al Nojoom electronic system for customs declarations. Hamad Port and Hamad International Airport are main entry points. Qatar Free Zones (QFZ) offer duty-free import regimes.",
